==============================================================================
III. J_3 VARIANCE IS THE ADDITIVE-ENERGY AXIS
==============================================================================
Fit over the full orientation cube: Var(J_3) = a*E(S) + b.
Empirically a = 1/(p-1) and b = -(p^2 - 2p + 5)/16 exactly.
p= 7 cube=   8 a=0.166666666667 |a-1/(p-1)|=2.78e-17 b=-2.500000 |b-b_p|=8.88e-16 maxerr=4.44e-16
